      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "At room temperature, refined nanocrystalline structure and improved adhesion reduce wear through localized grain-boundary-mediated plasticity.",
